{"title":"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1:_With_Algebra\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1: With Algebra</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2:_Fakesolving\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2: Fakesolving</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A shop advertises everything is \"half price in today's sale.\" In addition, a coupon gives a 20% discount on sale prices. Using the coupon, the price today represents what percentage off the original price?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/b/f1be92644d89a8aa28f6af61e53819259bcb6646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\hspace{.05in}10\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\hspace{.05in}33\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\hspace{.05in}40\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\hspace{.05in}60\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\hspace{.05in}70$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"396\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1:_With_Algebra\">Solution 1: With Algebra</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1: With Algebra\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the original price of an item be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>First, everything is half-off, so the price is now <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/3/0a31d4631b54cd55c6089c68f29ae897d68efe2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{x}{2} = 0.5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"71\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>Next, the extra coupon applies <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off on the <i>sale price</i>, so the price after this discount will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/a/4fa3b51f722488cf3580ad2c903c620e6d954345.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 20\\% = 80\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"154\" height=\"14\" /> of what it was before. (Notice how this is not applied to the original price; if it were, the solution would be applying <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/9/509a73b0789d8c83518784fedb1fa90b23e9f0a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\% + 20\\% = 70\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"17\" /> off the original price.)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86cd65a60ac96735c4a4561732c7c9dfd13160b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80\\% \\cdot 0.5 x = \\frac{4}{5} \\cdot 0.5 x = 0.4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"221\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>The price of the item after all discounts have been applied is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/1/481aa63209ffa997da9cd02e9c80f02105e8c153.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.4x = 40\\% \\cdot x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"14\" />. However, we need to find the percentage off the original price, not the current percentage of the original price. We then subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/c/dcc059f0db4c66573ec109696f66a9489cea1560.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$40\\% x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/3/5f37d286af6a2c69b0c7ed050f10c1e2d981307f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" /> (the original price of the item), to find the answer, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b30b3bf8184b30463376208684b6d3b376be835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2:_Fakesolving\">Solution 2: Fakesolving</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2: Fakesolving\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the problem implies that the percentage off the original price will be the same for every item in the store, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Fakesolving\" title=\"Fakesolving\">fakesolving</a> is applicable here. Say we are buying an item worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dollars, a convenient number to work with. First, it is clear that we'll get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off, which makes the price then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. Taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. Therefore, we have saved a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/8/7b861729a1a4afe5a5dc2a507c14a92fc97f0cda.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{10-4}{10} = \\frac{6}{10} = \\frac{60}{100} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60} \\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"258\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3:\">Solution 3:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The percent off would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> because it has an additional <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off of half the price. The answer to that would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b56bd637cb2c936d539be1b5000a64a898af389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" />. You could do <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/b/f6b12fcd6e9161bde101946b86210ba97d2f1826.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\% + 50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"91\" height=\"17\" /> to find the answer. This answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/3/0b30b3bf8184b30463376208684b6d3b376be835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~ SmartGrowth\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4:\">Solution 4:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> off, which means the price would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4abb40acf432ba85ca96e76606d20d206beb7d76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 50\\% = 50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" /> of what it was before. Then, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off. Sidenote: A common mistake is finding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of the price, but forgetting to subtract it. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> off the price is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/b/dcb22bbf310fe22432fc41af9a5d2a7c8ce91a7d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 20\\% = 80\\%.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"162\" height=\"17\" /> Now, we can multiply the two discounts as decimals. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1a641bd3f01b18ac4f7bac11c083b2f0484972.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5 \\times 0.8 = 0.4 = 40\\%.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"17\" /> Our final answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/7/087fd136404188894ad7ccfd7a2b519eb3e80221.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 40\\% = \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ 60\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"204\" height=\"31\" />\n</p><p>~ ENDERGAMER25/Endy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SYou4OZcq1E\">https://youtu.be/SYou4OZcq1E</a> ~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8\" title=\"2012 AMC 8\">2012 AMC 8</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Answer_Key\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=2012\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2012 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_8_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 8 Problems and Solutions\"> All AJHSME/AMC 8 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017151639\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.128 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 236/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2268/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHi